---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Terms and Conditions - Playback speed Calculator" description="Terms and conditions for using Playback speed Calculator online playback speed calculator.">
  <section class="section-container" style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-link);">Terms and Conditions</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-xl); color: var(--color-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Last updated: November 2026
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Welcome to Playback speed Calculator. These terms govern your use of our website and playback speed calculator at realplaybackspeed.com. By using our site, you agree to these terms.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Use of the Calculator</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Our calculator is provided "as is" for informational purposes. Results are estimates based on the duration and speed you enter. We do not guarantee accuracy for third-party media or platforms. Actual playback time may vary by player and content type.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Third-Party Platforms</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      We are not affiliated with YouTube, Spotify, Netflix, TikTok, or Instagram. Trademarks belong to their respective owners. Playback speed features depend on each platform's own app and policies.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, Playback speed Calculator is not liable for any damages arising from your use of the calculator or reliance on its results.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Questions? Visit our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-link);">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
